#: Data/Properties.py:55
msgid "Bake the data into a UV map"
msgstr "将数据烘焙到 UV 贴图"

#: Data/Properties.py:57
msgid "Bake the data into the U or V channel of a UV map, along with the target data layer using numeric packing. Expect moderate precision loss. Packing in the V channel is safe"
msgstr "将数据通过数值打包与目标数据层一起烘焙到 UV 贴图的 U 或 V 通道。预计会有中等精度损失。打包到 V 通道是安全的"

#: Data/Properties.py:59
msgid "Bake the data into the V channel of a UV map, along with the target data layer using numeric packing. Expect high precision loss. Packing in the V channel is safe"
msgstr "将数据通过数值打包与目标数据层一起烘焙到 UV 贴图的 V 通道。预计会有较高精度损失。打包到 V 通道是安全的"

#: Data/Properties.py:60
msgid "Bake the data into the fractional part of a UV map, along with the target data which will be floored"
msgstr "将数据烘焙到 UV 贴图的小数部分，同时将目标数据向下取整"

#: Data/Properties.py:58
msgid "Bake the data preferably into the U channel of a UV map, along with another layer and the target data layer using 11-, 10- and 10-bit precision. Expect moderate precision loss. !!PACKING IN THE V CHANNEL IS DANGEROUS!!"
msgstr "优先将数据使用 11、10 和 10 位精度，与另一图层及目标数据层一起烘焙到 UV 贴图的 U 通道。预计会有中等精度损失。!!打包到 V 通道很危险!!"

#: Data/Properties.py:56
msgid "Bake the data preferably into the U channel of a UV map, along with the target data layer using 16- and 15-bit precision. Expect some precision loss. !!PACKING IN THE V CHANNEL IS DANGEROUS!!"
msgstr "优先将数据使用 16 位和 15 位精度，与目标数据层一起烘焙到 UV 贴图的 U 通道。预计会有一些精度损失。!!打包到 V 通道很危险!!"

#: VertexAnimation/Properties.py:33
msgid "Bake vertex animation data based on the selected mesh sequence. Frame order must be deducible from the objects names (.000, .001 etc). Vertex count AND order must be maintained during the animation"
msgstr "基于选中的网格序列烘焙顶点动画数据。帧顺序必须能从物体名称（.000、.001 等）推断。动画过程中必须保持顶点数量和顺序"

#: VertexAnimation/Properties.py:32
msgid "Bake vertex animation data based on the selected objects vertices movement inherited from armatures, shapekeys, transforms or any other animation methods. Vertex count AND order must be maintained during the animation"
