#: Data/Properties.py:195
#: ObjectAttributes/Properties.py:124
msgid "Enable merging of the duplicated selection once baking is complete. Otherwise, keep them separated to allow for additional bakes on the individual objects"
msgstr "启用后在烘焙完成后合并复制的选择。否则保持分离，以便对各个物体进行额外烘焙"

#: ObjectAttributes/Properties.py:117
msgid "Enable the use of Pivot Painter's 16-bit integer to 16-bit float packing algorithm to store the index. If disabled, the index will be stored as-is in a float. When packing is enabled, the index must be decoded before use; otherwise, it can be read directly. Note that 16-bit floats can only reliably store integers as-is up to 2048"
msgstr "启用 Pivot Painter 的 16 位整数到 16 位浮点打包算法来存储索引。禁用时，索引将按原样存储在浮点数中。启用打包后，使用前必须解码索引；否则可直接读取。注意，16 位浮点数只能可靠地按原样存储最大到 2048 的整数"

#: ObjectAttributes/Properties.py:125
msgid "Enable this option to preserve the original selection and bake data on the duplicated mesh. Disable it at your own risk—doing so will modify the selection, which may lead to unwanted changes to the source data and unpredictable bake results if data blocks are shared"
msgstr "启用此选项以在复制的网格上保留原始选择和烘焙数据。禁用它需自行承担风险——这样做会修改选择，若数据块共享，可能导致源数据发生意外更改以及不可预测的烘焙结果"

#: Data/Properties.py:196
msgid "Enable this option to preserve the original selection and bake data on the duplicated mesh. Disable it at your own risk—doing so will modify the selection, which may lead to unwanted changes to the source data and unpredictable bake results if data blocks are shared or have modifiers."
msgstr "启用此选项以在复制的网格上保留原始选择和烘焙数据。禁用它需自行承担风险——这样做会修改选择，若数据块共享或带有修改器，可能导致源数据发生意外更改以及不可预测的烘焙结果"

#: ObjectAttributes/Properties.py:115
msgid "Enable this option to prevent the hierarchy from becoming too deep. At the specified depth, children will be treated as part of their parent and will share the parent’s object data—such as position, axis, and more—as if they were part of the same mesh. Non-mesh objects within the hierarchy will be discarded and treated as if they do not exist by the algorithm, without affecting the transforms of their children"
msgstr "启用此选项可防止层级过深。在指定深度处，子级将被视为其父级的一部分，并共享父级的物体数据——例如位置、轴等——如同它们属于同一网格。层级中的非网格物体将被丢弃，算法会将其视为不存在，且不影响其子级的变换"

#: Data/Properties.py:214
msgid "Enable this option to remove face corner attributes that store the raw vertex data for each layer. These attributes are named using each layer's unique ID, created and used internally during baking, and are unlikely to be useful after the bake is complete"
msgstr "启用此选项可移除存储每层原始顶点数据的面角属性。这些属性使用每层的唯一 ID 命名，在烘焙期间内部创建和使用，烘焙完成后通常不再有用"

#: BoneAnimation/Properties.py:171
