#: VertexAnimation/Properties.py:120
msgid "Enable to remap the normals within a [0:1] range. This requires a constant bias to remap the normals in your shader or game engine. It is likely safe to do so, as normal VAT may be stored in an 8-bit RGBA texture without noticeable precision loss"
msgstr "启用后将法线重映射到 [0:1] 范围。这需要在着色器或游戏引擎中使用常量偏置来重映射法线。这样做通常是安全的，因为法线 VAT 可存储在 8 位 RGBA 纹理中，而不会有明显精度损失"

#: VertexAnimation/Properties.py:117
msgid "Enable to remap the offsets within a [0:1] range. This requires a multiplier and bias to remap the offsets in your shader or game engine. It is NOT recommended unless you intend to experiment with storing positions/offsets in 8-bit RGBA textures, as this will likely result in significant precision loss and visible deformation. Proceed at your own risk"
msgstr "启用后将偏移重映射到 [0:1] 范围。这需要在着色器或游戏引擎中使用乘数和偏置来重映射偏移。除非打算试验将位置/偏移存储在 8 位 RGBA 纹理中，否则不建议这样做，因为这很可能导致显著的精度损失和可见变形。请自行承担风险"

#: BoneAnimation/Properties.py:128
#: BoneAnimation/Properties.py:376
msgid "Enable to remap values stored in this channel from their initial [-min:max] range to [0:1] which can later be brought back to their initial range using the reported offset and range values. This may allow 8-bit RGBA textures to be used for storing data."
msgstr "启用后将此通道中存储的值从初始 [-min:max] 范围重映射到 [0:1]，之后可使用报告的偏移和范围值恢复到初始范围。这可能允许使用 8 位 RGBA 纹理存储数据"

